<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts Heritage from recommended.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ cuts Heritage from recommended.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Friday removed Heritage Media Corp from its recommended list, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- DLJ cut its rating to buy from recommended and set a 12-month target price of $17 a share, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Heritage Media dropped 2-3/4 to 10-1/2 in afternoon trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
